40
00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.610
or you're the wrong skin color,

41
00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:32.770
or you have the wrong ethnicity.

42
00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:35.910
And if you get these nonstop little stressors

43
00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:37.430
that you have no control over,

44
00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:41.250
over time, that changes the systems in your body

45
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:42.510
that control stress.

46
00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:45.270
And it can really have profound impact

47
00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.330
on your mental health and on your physical health.

48
00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:49.470
And when it comes to the brain,

49
00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:51.800
