56
00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:15.040
and become more typically regulated.

57
00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.023
And ultimately,

58
00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.850
you can heal.

59
00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:22.640
Oprah said something about how there is good news

60
00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:25.760
